1315
01:02:09.480 --> 01:02:10.300
Oh, yes.

1316
01:02:10.440 --> 01:02:10.760
Right?

1317
01:02:11.800 --> 01:02:13.600
Not for stacking.

1318
01:02:13.820 --> 01:02:15.620
I don't love for stacking, no.

