1413
01:08:03.300 --> 01:08:03.980
another mouse.

1414
01:08:05.120 --> 01:08:09.240
I thought it was amazing that the mouse stayed on the cat when the cat jumped off.

1415
01:08:09.660 --> 01:08:10.560
I know.

1416
01:08:10.920 --> 01:08:12.280
Well done, mouse actor.

1417
01:08:12.660 --> 01:08:13.180
Yes.

1418
01:08:13.720 --> 01:08:15.440
Way to roll with some improv there.

1419
