And Jim says they're going to need a lot more than counseling if Pam won't move to Philly.

1444
01:09:31.520 --> 01:09:34.200
We then see a scene of Jim and Pam.

1445
01:09:34.380 --> 01:09:39.200
They're walking to their car and Jim kind of strokes Pam's back and they get in.

