01:09:39.980 --> 01:09:43.860
And this is really somber for the Jim and Pam fandom.

1447
01:09:45.440 --> 01:09:49.200
Nellie and Toby have now done being couples counselors and I think it bonded them.

1448
01:09:49.380 --> 01:09:51.420
They're both like, oh, those two are made for each other.

