I know.

1498
01:12:18.960 --> 01:12:25.220
And he's sort of like, she asks him to list his talents, and he's sort of like, and one

1499
01:12:25.220 --> 01:12:29.960
of my talents is that I can speak in a British accent, and he switches to American accent.

1500
01:12:29.960 --> 01:12:37.260
My favorite moment of this scene is that Carla's response to this accent reveal is to simply

1501
