1513
01:13:18.220 --> 01:13:20.240
And then he thinks he didn't get an agent.

1514
01:13:20.520 --> 01:13:23.200
But she says, oh, no, we're going to sign you.

1515
01:13:23.380 --> 01:13:23.640
Yeah.

1516
01:13:23.820 --> 01:13:26.300
She says, pay Todd on the way out.

1517
01:13:26.660 --> 01:13:27.700
Oh, you guys.

1518
01:13:28.020 --> 01:13:28.440
Yes.

1519
01:13:28.440 --> 01:13:29.900
You do not pay for representation.

1520
01:13:30.340 --> 01:13:31.320
You do not.

1521
01:13:31.560 --> 01:13:32.360
Acting 101.

1522
01:13:33.180 --> 01:13:33.640
No.

1523
01:13:33.880 --> 01:13:34.140
No.

1524
01:13:34.140 --> 01:13:40.380
But the way Carla Fern's agency works is that Carla takes a flat rate of $5,000 up front.

1525
01:13:40.700 --> 01:13:42.320
That does not include headshots.

1526
01:13:42.400 --> 01:13:43.060
It does not.

