1530
01:13:52.780 --> 01:13:55.860
We knew Ben, and this was a really fun way to get him in the show.

1531
01:13:56.420 --> 01:13:58.400
And we got a fan question from Brooke S.

1532
01:13:58.500 --> 01:13:59.380
in Utah who said,

1533
01:13:59.480 --> 01:14:03.760
I listened to Jenna's book for aspiring actors, even though it's not my goal in life.

1534
01:14:03.760 --> 01:14:08.020
