1587
01:16:59.920 --> 01:17:04.820
And you so want that agent, just like Andy, you know, you so want that.

1588
01:17:04.940 --> 01:17:08.820
And people will try to take advantage of that, you know?

1589
01:17:09.020 --> 01:17:13.220
And so you have to be really smart and savvy and thoughtful.

1590
01:17:13.580 --> 01:17:14.260
And you know what?

1591
01:17:14.380 --> 01:17:15.620
It will eventually happen.

1592
01:17:15.720 --> 01:17:16.440
It will.

1593
01:17:16.440 --> 01:17:21.000
Yeah, and have good friends and people you can bounce the stuff off of.

1594
01:17:21.300 --> 01:17:27.360
So if your excitement makes you blind to some red flags, your support group will catch them.

1595
01:17:27.600 --> 01:17:28.820
Yes, 100%.

1596
01:17:28.820 --> 01:17:29.040
Yeah.

1597
